 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Text translation
+
+The homepage and `/devtools-times/translate` include a text translator for 16 languages, with language swapping, copy, device text-to-speech, and three recent translations stored locally. Text is sent through `POST /devtools-times/api/translate` to [MyMemory](https://mymemory.translated.net/doc/spec.php); no API key is needed. The public service has daily usage limits and requires network access. Requests are limited to 1,000 characters and split at UTF-8 byte boundaries for the provider.
+
+Run the translation tests with `pnpm test:translation` (Node 22.18+ or Node 24). Build with `pnpm build`.
